    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nAn exceptional and truly unique property comprising two A rated detached bungalows set on approximately 3.5 acres, offering an outstanding opportunity for a family home, multi-generational living or a home with excellent potential for additional income.\n\nBoth properties are presented in turnkey condition and have been maintained to a high standard by the current owners. Both benefit from air-to-water heating systems, providing modern and efficient heating throughout.\n\nThe main residence extends to approximately 3,500 sq. ft. and offers generous accommodation, including five bedrooms on the ground floor, with a further three rooms on the first floor.\nThe second detached bungalow extends to over 2,300 sq. ft. and was completed in 2022. Finished to a high standard, it features a stunning modern kitchen with quartz worktops, along with spacious and versatile accommodation throughout.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from a large decking area, extensive tarmacadam driveway and ample private parking. The surrounding grounds provide an excellent sense of space, privacy and tranquillity, while the property enjoys stunning panoramic countryside views which truly need to be seen to be appreciated.\n\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire such a substantial property with two separate homes on one site. It would be ideally suited to a family seeking a property suitable for multi-generational living, or buyers seeking the potential to generate an additional rental or investment income.\n\nThe property is situated in a peaceful rural setting while remaining within easy reach of local towns and amenities. It is approximately 10 km from Millstreet, 13 km from Kanturk and just 7 km from Banteer train station, providing convenient access to surrounding areas.\n\nProperties of this nature and scale rarely come to the market. Early viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, space, versatility and exceptional setting this unique property has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nMain House - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 5.94m x 12.08\nTiled flooring. Cornicing to ceiling.\n\nKitchen/Dining - 8.33m x 5.60m\nTiled Flooring. Open plan kitchen/dining, Solid oak kitchen with granite work tops. Feature Island.\n\nUtility Room - 2.04m x 5.60m\nTiled Flooring. Fully Fitted kitchen with sink. Plumbed for washing machine and dryer. Door to rear.\n\nGuest w.c - 2.22m x 1.5m\nFully Tiled, Shower, WHB and Toilet.\n\nSun Room - 3.81m x 4.20m\nTiled flooring, Recessed lighting. Beams to ceiling, Solid fuel stove with feature surround. Double doors to rear decking.\n\nLiving Room - 4.18m x 4.25m\nSolid wood Flooring. Solid fuel fire.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 5.08m x 4.47m\nSolid wood flooring.\n\nWalk in wardrobe - 1.83m x 2.40m\nSolid wood flooring. Fitted shelves.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.42m x 2.36m\nFully Tiled, Jacuzzi corner bath and walk in shower\n\nEn-Suite/ Toilet - 1m x 2.36m\nTiled Flooring. Feature tiled whb and toilet.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.18m x 4.25m\nSolid wood flooring\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.54m x 3.56m\nSolid wood flooring, W.I.R\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.54m x 3.24m\nSolid wood flooring with W.I.R\n\nBedroom 5 - 3.12m x2.63m\nSolid wood flooring\n\nBathroom - 3.12m x 2.49m\nFully Tiled, Shower Bath, Feature Whb with granite worktop and Toilet\n\nUpstairs - \n\n\nStorage room 1 - 4.90m x 4.50\nTimber Flooring.\n\nStorage room 2 - 4.90m x 10.11m\nTimber flooring\n\nStorage room 3 - 4.90m x 4.20m\nTimber flooring\n\nHOUSE TWO - \n\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.68m x 6.13m\nRecessed Lighting, Porcelain tiled Flooring.\n\nKitchen - 8.40m x 5.20m\nTiled flooring, Recessed Lighting. Fully fited kitchen with Quartz worktops, feature island.\n\nUtility Room - 3.62m x 2.46m\nTiled flooring, Fully fitted units with sink. Plumbed for washing machine and dryer. Door to rear.\n\nShower room - 3.10m x 1.23m\nFully tiled, Whb, Toilet and shower\n\nLiving Room - 8.40m x 6.00m\nLaminate flooring, Double doors to rear.\n\nBathroom - 3.62m x 3.50m\nFully tiled, Double walk in shower, Whb with Vanity and Bath\n\nLanding - 2.54m x 1.52m\nLaminate Flooring.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.86m x 10.61m\nLaminate flooring, Recessed lighting\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.86m x 5.27m\nLaminate flooring, Recessed lighting.\n\n"
